一个便携式自动材料提取仪。\n\t\t- 1级铁匠技能，2级机械和电子技能。\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：放电系 （未解锁）- 使用火焰和闪电\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：寒岩系 （未解锁）- 使用土和水\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：玄机系 （未解锁）- 使用时间和奥术\n\t\t- 你可以免费解锁三个科技法术系的其中之一。\n\n\t\t奥术发电机装入长袍后，每当你消耗法力值时都会产生蒸汽，并根据当前蒸汽值提升法术强度。\n\n\t\t#{bold}#一旦使用此进阶，你就需要制作奥术发电机并装入长袍，才能获得科技法师的全部能力。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26818d08280b5f9f441edb8165552edb23931d5aea896a962abe2a2f85dc8f20","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9af85549cbb145eb1155150d5fb1fbfa41f1b20b112f514d5ff5909a06e8d2ac","logical_entry_identity":"eb06c7302a3b05bb41a3f5bfa555dec81c3a89dfb51ed02cfaa2814ad5254b9e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Second Skin","source_tag":"_t","target":"第二皮肤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2a99bd246be44f4681976118915ec575b33d65f9fcba3f1c1416f6a3bbee9480","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b031567514f67f16832e1bfa3193575218b229a1bd0518f02e1f408e31f48a2","logical_entry_identity":"760903e86c24651463d8c21095a2777713e7ba4c6e8264bf99eebccf3e836e95","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Enhance your grenade with an incendiary agent that burns through armor, dealing fire damage over 3 turns and increasing damage taken while burning by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用高度易燃物质强化榴弹，烧蚀敌人护甲，3回合内造成火焰伤害，在目标燃烧时增加所受到的伤害 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"78db97e9d94c429fa851c9e8059efd6047c49c1bbee636957c71fc641b019be4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b1b2e80eec65f31e521d960abf1e5e0613ad18c400c20cf01909bcafdbc1ebf","logical_entry_identity":"c9f70427e6117504f020fbf6d7ff3a232464bc900ed96d22de8f9d2124467121","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"%s shocking edge","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s 电击之刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2400dde4392874ed9311852fa89b2b32faabadf3670167e6017cf742d3ab19de","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b1e1714f78df333bc5396d6c78fda4f642028c9428d09caf5d05e21d2cca411","logical_entry_identity":"ecb57f35f9e77e6a3c1405d4c8b49e6307009c5c8aca48325681f77ed3082c6c","normalized_